3. Circuit Breaker
Order Service already had Circuit Breaker implementation.
Circuit Breaker protects Order Service when User Service fails.
Added/used fallback response:
User Service is currently unavailable
When User Service was stopped, API returned:
503 Service Unavailable
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
4. Added Resilience4j Retry

Added @Retry to UserClient.java.

@Retry(name = "userService")
public UserResponse getUserById(Long userId) {...}
This means:
Order Service
      ↓
Try User Service
      ↓
Failure
      ↓
Retry
      ↓
Failure
      ↓
Retry
      ↓
Fallback
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
5. Retry Configuration : 

Added configuration to Config Server → ORDER-SERVICE-dev.properties:
resilience4j.retry.instances.userService.maxAttempts=3
resilience4j.retry.instances.userService.waitDuration=500ms
logging.level.io.github.resilience4j.retry=DEBUG
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
6. Removed Manual Retry
UserClient.java originally had a manual for loop for retry.
